<wpt lat="38.537112" lon="-105.990952"><name>Coffee: Salida</name><desc>Mile 0. Brown Dog, 105 F; Bunny and Clyde's, 203 W 1st (hours not found).</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.537571" lon="-105.993496"><name>Fuel: Conoco, 337 W 1st</name><desc>Mile 0.2.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.812468" lon="-106.106574"><name>Fuel: Johnson Village</name><desc>Mile 22.5. 64 miles to the next on this line: more than one in Buena Vista too (25, 26).</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.842308" lon="-106.130845"><name>Coffee: Buena Vista</name><desc>Mile 25.5. The Long Table, 302 E Main, from 8, 719-966-8819; Brown Dog, 713 US 24, 6:30 to 6 (listings).</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.844555" lon="-106.130163"><name>Way out: Right on E Main, left on N Colorado, CR 371</name><desc>Mile 25.7. Quick way from here: US 24 and US 285 to Fairplay, 38 mi, paved. Past the tunnels along the Arkansas.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.176213" lon="-106.321809"><name>Way out: DECIDE: right onto CR 10, Weston Pass</name><desc>Mile 52.8. Gate at the bottom: close it. Wet? Back to US 285: 64 mi to Fairplay, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.162377" lon="-106.273970"><name>Rough: The climb, CR 7</name><desc>Mile 56.9. Rockier near the top, 11,921 ft.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.219064" lon="-105.993911"><name>Fuel: Fairplay</name><desc>Mile 89.9. Exxon, Sinclair. Lunch here if it's late (half a mile into town).</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.311089" lon="-105.886772"><name>Way out: Left onto CR 33, Como</name><desc>Mile 99.4. Boreas closed or storming? Back to Fairplay, CO 9 over Hoosier: 31 mi, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.475412" lon="-106.043348"><name>Lunch: Breckenridge</name><desc>Mile 121.5. Breckenridge Ale House &amp; Pizza, 520 S Main, from 11, 970-771-3637; Breckenridge Brewery, 600 S Main, 11 to 8; Downstairs at Eric's, 111 S Main, from 11, 970-453-1401. Coffee: The Crown, S Main, 8 to 6, 970-453-6022. Hours from map data, not confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.490788" lon="-106.045493"><name>Fuel: Breckenridge</name><desc>Mile 122.6.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.713435" lon="-105.696859"><name>Fuel: Georgetown, exit 228</name><desc>Mile 160.4.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.762919" lon="-105.233364"><name>Fuel: Golden, just past the turn</name><desc>Mile 191.8.</desc></wpt>
